{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6895aee1a1daf365dd27f8c556f16843948da15ab3e62cc49ea4b5a78a177177", "ja": "茜、新しい衣装の具合はどう……", "zh": "茜，新衣服穿起来感觉怎么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "0952603e6c06f051d1d92bc69a01ae27611cdb80119eaad787f4bd991e76cd49", "ja": "おっ、とっ、ああっ、あああぁっ！？", "zh": "哦、哎、啊、啊啊啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1002_se", "source_sha256": "a5cfdfc8296aae596e1065fcfa80eaf7dede07085b0ffde5d351344253106f3d", "ja": "ガチャーン！", "zh": "哐当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6cc9a4d5ea2983b8950a5fd5364cc802891232b876976c51adf3d1f0b33aed30", "ja": "ど、どうした！？", "zh": "怎、怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "cfaf4aeedb7f7c90b22eaf847b1e0b93c467eb83b0385a118e4d966585a4c6de", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！\nだっ、大丈夫！　ほら壊れてない、壊れてないよ！？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n没、没事的！你看，没坏，完全没坏哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bc866bbc8f9ecb5bf9dbefc0a5cdb35921660d973742b4f62c6a83a9550a34c1", "ja": "ああ、足についてる小道具の銃が落ちたのか。\n……まあ、大丈夫そうだな。", "zh": "啊，是脚上装着的道具枪掉了吗。\n……嗯，看起来应该没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "68bd7b779a007440043a1f767f3ed7a9ec78fe6f04b0cb1243998b97c13801f2", "ja": "いや～ゴメンゴメン！　ちょっとあの、くるくる～、\nスパン！　ってやつ、やってみたんだけどね～。", "zh": "哎呀～抱歉抱歉！人家只是想试试那个，转转转～，\n然后啪！的一下收枪的动作嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1007_p", "source_sha256": "67fbdb727cadbc70a4290556f4e609a0c13ae3543b535b5dce0e9134f860d6d7", "ja": "くるくる？　……ああ、西部劇とかで、\nガンマンが拳銃をホルスターにしまう時の？", "zh": "转来转去？……啊，是西部片里，枪手把手枪收回枪套时做的那个动作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "35833af3281d7bc0099f15f2013251a46bbc7b5b90ec5c174874fb1cf437f9fe", "ja": "そう！　だって、せっかく衣装についてるんだから、\nちゃんと活かして使いこなさないと！", "zh": "没错！毕竟服装上难得配了这个，不好好发挥它的作用、熟练运用可不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "0e804569113e94a8d9b1c727579089c0f06c5aab71a049ff5c3b3b30c0b6ac7d", "ja": "しかも見て見て！　すっごく細かいとこまで作りこんで\nくれてるの。今のが成功したら絶対盛り上がるでしょ？", "zh": "而且你看你看！连这么细致的地方都精心制作了。刚才那个要是成功了，绝对会热闹起来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1b226bb133df81b5354bde7e14f7f64d9d853fb812f8c2f9490baba0473b5b87", "ja": "（なるほど、ファンの受けを考えて……。\n小道具が嬉しいだけじゃないんだな）", "zh": "（原来如此，是在考虑粉丝们会不会喜欢……她并不只是因为道具感到高兴啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "cddd6e12486ffbfc3da7a0482f28abc1845c1e0e82492c7a9b7cb229e609a083", "ja": "てことで、もう1回やってみるから、\n{$P$}ちゃんはそこで見ててね？", "zh": "所以，我就再试1次，{$P$}你在那儿看着哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8cc280d9564c0d1c5499975c9c792eb0e5b2e4a2a1b445cbb1f45ebfa9ead6d8", "ja": "えっ？　でも、本当にできるのか？\nさっきは、なかなか盛大に落としたみたいだけど。", "zh": "咦？不过，真的能做到吗？\n刚才好像摔得相当惨来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "ef7b2a65813bbe2bdebb9e723c71a60ab92b1aa3dd2502cdd6efffa25a9882be", "ja": "大丈夫！　茜ちゃんはできる子！\n基本的に天才なので、過ちは繰り返しまセーン！", "zh": "没问题！小茜可是很能干的孩子！毕竟基本上就是天才，才不会重蹈覆辙——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1014_se", "source_sha256": "8658297d3b5f8d5928cbfe14de51b9ef92f740b7b55516ec16a26ddcec524405", "ja": "スチャッ", "zh": "唰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "3c19b41bf3d5175758236e8cc4b1cdfef4f3c3edfc260edd59cb58cabae4b656", "ja": "ふーっ。その銃弾は茜ちゃんからのプレゼント。\n良い子は家に帰ってオネンネしてな。……あばよ！", "zh": "呼——那颗子弹是来自小茜的礼物。乖孩子就回家睡觉去吧。……再见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0554_1016_se", "source_sha256": "a5cfdfc8296aae596e1065fcfa80eaf7dede07085b0ffde5d351344253106f3d", "ja": "ガチャーン！", "zh": "哐当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
